      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont know... i feel like im just performing all day. every time i leave the house or talk to people it feels like i'm playing a character of someone who actually belongs here. it’s so fucking exhausting to pretend. i just feel like i'm fundamentally broken in a way that no amount of \"trying\" is ever gonna fix.",
